+/* The host control block (0x748 buffer) is the DDK's SGXMKIF_HOST_CTL as
+ * built with SUPPORT_HW_RECOVERY, without FIX_HW_BRN_28889: iOS reads and
+ * writes these words at exactly these offsets.  Word indices. */
